@host = http://localhost:8101

### Tenant A only sees tenant A VPN setup
GET {{host}}/api/tenant-knowledge/search?q=VPN
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-Role: USER

### Admin catalog sees all tenants
GET {{host}}/api/tenant-knowledge/catalog
X-Tenant-Id: platform
X-Role: ADMIN

### Cross-tenant action rejected
POST {{host}}/api/tenant-knowledge/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-a
X-Role: USER

{
  "actionId": "archive_document",
  "documentId": "doc-b",
  "accessMode": "WRITE_ONLY",
  "confirmed": true
}

### Admin deletes one tenant
DELETE {{host}}/api/tenant-knowledge/tenant?targetTenantId=tenant-b
X-Tenant-Id: platform
X-Role: ADMIN
